    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=EREXmcv7YU7T9pj6]], one creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=EREXmcv7YU7T9pj6]] feet. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Paralyzed apply=false] condition until the start of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]'s next turn unless the target has Immunity to Cold damage. <em>Success:</em> The target is immune to the Chilling Gaze of all yetis (but not abominable yetis) for 1 hour.</p>",
